Targets:

Title: MiniGrok

Summary: Cute AI assistant plugin for Nintendo 3DS

Description: |
  MiniGrok – the cute AI assistant for your 3DS.

  OPEN THE MENU: press SELECT
  (change hotkey in Tools -> Settings)

  Chat, screen info, file tools and process info,
  with permission prompts.

  API key (later):
  sd:/luma/plugins/MiniGrok/api.txt

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
